Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.49,0:00:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Romila... Romila! 求你別死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King, 你恢復記憶了?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那時,城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,城堡被混沌軍隊艦隊包圍了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光榮的Shiva王國
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光榮的Shiva王和Romila王妃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我勇敢的戰士們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.66,0:02:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌軍隊的傭兵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King... 你是Shiva之王?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就那時,那個人把愛人的樣子燒到我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一個左手是槍的男人襲擊了你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個世界裡除了他別無他人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.11,0:03:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊,霧散了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:05:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遙遠的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hehe... 一個人都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.85,0:05:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令人懼怕的混沌士兵居然一個都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是把
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看是混沌士兵都去看足球賽去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.19,0:05:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了,大家板著個臉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剛從葬禮回來?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:06:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 你說你曾來過一次這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.18,0:06:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌軍隊進攻這裡時,我聽說他們僱傭了相當數量的一批外部勢力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成步堂, 哦,你是說我是那些傭兵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你對這張臉還有印象嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呀哈里, 那時的兇手就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亞美爹, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那怪物居然追到這來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King, 救救 Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra救了你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了, Cobra掛了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就報仇了, 不高興嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不見了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意到底是?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是混沌軍的母艦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成步堂, 就是這玩意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅達, 打開了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是金子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好多財寶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,財寶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這下都是我們的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯,都是我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你y的, 想吃獨食?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有趣, 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以為那種槍能對付我?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,y,這槍是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼,這把呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那時的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那時你幹的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.03,0:11:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正確
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這次請你好好去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌兵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen 是混沌兵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,y,這次奪回城堡的計劃也是她想出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送出了邀請函, 把我們聚到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個女人就是委託人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼會知道我是混沌兵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是問過你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以靠嗅覺辨別混沌兵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能聞到他們用來潤滑關節的油
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那, 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好香
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.15,0:12:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Parure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,強力, 感性
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還真適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Parure... Jean-Paul Guerlain生產的一種味道很強的香水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你用她來掩蓋潤滑油的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你怎麼知道是我發的委託書
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給我的信封上還殘留著一點Parure的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就是從一開始就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有慾望嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有趣,很有趣的個體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像我們這種純粹的群體智慧生命體\N居然創造出一個像人一樣有慾望的個體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們會同化你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你的知識就被我們共享了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亞美爹, 我還不想被同化
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命, Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是....什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌軍的老大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這城裡就剩下他了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙操縱著這裡所有的混沌軍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你對我們一族很瞭解嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去你房間拜訪了下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有留守的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就到母艦裡參觀了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,內部裝修不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就再告訴你一個我們的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們一族靠吞噬其他生命體, 來獲取他們的知識
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,子瑪麗, 你要吃我們了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可沒時間吃飯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,該到點了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到時間了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,會怎麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到你的御宅該消失的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:16:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌星人離開他們的身心保存體\N就無法在其他行星生存
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,連他們的老大也不例外
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母艦上的一個立場發生裝置\N在他身體周圍建立個防護罩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女王死了, 工蜂也會掛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.07,0:16:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,現在, 這裡的混沌星人都該倒斃了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美麗的Saldora會重生了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King, 你還是王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好幹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra... 我還不知道你來這的理由呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,財寶了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這紅寶石不錯, 應該可以買一個島了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這火箭還真破舊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘛, 應該還可以飛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這下我終於和這y分開了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你深愛著Frank,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那這個去換個身體吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可憐的 Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他那麼愛著財寶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra的通緝令
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack是想向Cobra報仇.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那張臉是?(好tmd的英俊)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra看來整容過
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是Cobra很久前的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞄準
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最後有什麼遺願嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有,防彈背心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.14,0:19:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面白的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜歡的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他是潛入城堡盜竊財寶的大盜賊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快這城就要和混沌軍開戰了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.61,0:19:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人會死
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算是小偷, 我也想救
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會還你人情的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:20:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這份情.我一定會還得
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前別死哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那時的男人是 Cobra?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra知道計劃上寫的 "King" 就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個男人再次回到了這個城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就為了向我報恩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.87,0:20:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 這段時間你跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.28,0:22:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼, 我不是跟你說了,我要去還點東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那對方等著要?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! 等了20年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了, 出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們得去找個大財寶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.51,0:23:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thx for watching. 很高興大家的支持,希望大家對我的一些口頭禪不要反感.
